WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:13.969
Ahmet Muhsin Tüzer is the Imam in the Turkish
village of Pinarbasi.

00:00:13.969 --> 00:00:18.770
He's calling the locals to Friday prayers.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:26.640
If it were up to Turkey's Directorate of Religious
Affairs – the Diyanet – Tüzer would no

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.880
longer be allowed to lead prayers in the village's
small mosque.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.150
He's been suspended without pay.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:39.470
But since a new imam hasn't been assigned
to the village so far, Tüzer continues to

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.500
conduct services.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.850
Authorities in the capital Ankara say that
his behaviour is "un-Islamic".

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:52.460
"If those who judge me would only try to understand
me a little and invite me to Ankara to familiarize

00:00:52.460 --> 00:01:00.059
themselves with my views and philosophy -- my
beliefs, my goals, my visions ... If only

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:05.280
they'd tried to understand me, none of this
would've happened.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:10.680
But unfortunately, this is the work of people
who do not understand justice and truth, the

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.590
real universality of Islam and its glory."

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:23.680
Tüzer is a fan of "Anadolu" rock music.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:31.730
That has made him famous across the country
as the "rockin' Imam."

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:36.439
That hasn't gone down well with the religious
authorities, however -- who are also the EMPLOYERS

00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:38.640
of Turkey's muslim preachers.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:47.750
But Tüzer refuses to be sidelined.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.880
My grandfather was a Koran teacher and my
father was an Imam, so I've been confronted

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.770
with religious tones since I was a child.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:01.950
My brothers and I were the first people in
Turkey to release an album with prayers put

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.640
to music.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:07.740
Islamic sounds, verses from the Koran, prayers
and hymns have been a fundamental part of

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:13.590
me since childhood.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:18.370
The first time the Diyanet sent an inspector
to question Tüzer was after he performed

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:23.180
a concert five years ago in the nearby coastal
town of Kaş.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.959
Then after a concert in spring 2018 he was
suspended.

00:02:26.959 --> 00:02:29.370
He then launched an appeal.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:34.290
While he continues to rehearse, Tüzer says
he won't actually perform concerts while the

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:36.160
case is pending.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:40.170
Many people in Kaş are frustrated with the
religious authorities' conduct, and say there

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:44.430
is no justification for Tüzer's suspension.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:49.010
"If the Imam does his job properly, where's
the problem?

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:52.320
And he does do his job -- and music is his
hobby.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.900
He also could have had scuba-diving as a hobby.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.900
But because he's an Imam, he also definitely
has a strong voice.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.069
And he uses it.

00:03:00.069 --> 00:03:06.129
In my opinion, the ideology that has been
popular in Turkey for the past 16 or 17 years

00:03:06.129 --> 00:03:09.520
has nothing to do with true Islam.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.660
It puts pressure on people.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:19.810
But so far all seems well in Tüzer's village,
Pinarbasi -- even if the "Rockin' Imam" knows

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:26.519
he also has a lot of adversaries in Turkey.

00:03:26.519 --> 00:03:30.769
People who think that their idea of faith
is the only true one act very negatively towards

00:03:30.769 --> 00:03:32.030
me.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:40.110
In other words, it's particularly the extremists
who keep threatening me -- sad as it may be

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.659
to say.

00:03:41.659 --> 00:03:48.920
Nevertheless, Tüzer wants to continue being
both an Imam and musician, and hopes the court

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:57.470
won't be too hard on him.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:02.019
Should the appeal against his suspension be
rejected, Tüzer will no longer be able to

00:04:02.019 --> 00:04:04.760
call the villagers to prayer in the local
mosque ...

